WEBVTT

00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:13.390
Saint Seiya

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:34.460
Next is the Cancer house.

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:39.150
An empty house without Deathmask to guard it.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:41.550
Let's hurry to Athena's Temple.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:52.830
Transient Meeting

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:03.650
What is this Cosmo that
fills the Cancer house?

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:13.320
No, this is not a Cosmo
but the presence of death.

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:18.860
It feels like the entrance to the Underworld.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:20.980
Could it be?

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:23.990
Saga.

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:37.740
Saga.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:03.280
What's this?

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:18.080
That is the Yomotsu.

00:03:20.240 --> 00:03:26.380
The Cancer house entrance has
become the entrance to hell.

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:31.890
If we try to pass the Cancer
house, we'll fall into the hole.

00:03:33.790 --> 00:03:37.240
Is it telling us to return to hell?

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:42.240
Idiot, it must be an
illusion someone created.

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.020
True.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:49.320
But who could create such an illusion?

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:55.860
Saga.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.860
What's this?

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.670
The dead stuck in limbo between
this world and the Underworld.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.180
What is this unsettling atmosphere?

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:26.440
Is this really the Sanctuary?

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.050
I wonder if Old Master is safe.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:33.870
I can barely feel his Cosmo.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:43.490
No, I can't stay here.
I must help Old Master.

00:04:54.190 --> 00:04:54.850
Who is it?

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.770
This Cosmo?

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:14.970
Vanish!

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:23.840
I don't know. Who is
creating these illusions?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.590
Saga, even you who sensed Canon

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:29.410
in the Pope's chambers from the Gemini house,

00:05:29.420 --> 00:05:31.050
can't figure it out?

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:35.770
To confuse us with his Cosmo

00:05:35.780 --> 00:05:39.480
without giving away his presence.

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:42.140
What a fearful opponent.

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:51.290
Damn these illusions!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:01.200
I don't know who created these illusions.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:06.260
But you think you can fool us
who came from the Underworld!

00:06:06.600 --> 00:06:07.210
Take this!

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:12.130
Galaxian Explosion!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.180
The illusions are gone.

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.290
We can't be stuck here forever.

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:35.200
By the way, are we still being followed?

00:06:35.590 --> 00:06:39.120
They're there, right behind us.

00:06:40.310 --> 00:06:44.160
The uninjured Cosmo of Aldebaran
has also disappeared.

00:06:44.840 --> 00:06:48.120
One of them must have
remained and killed him.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.590
Should we get this over with?

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.300
No, that's no good.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.960
We can deal with them anytime.

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:08.960
We need to get to Athena as soon as possible.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:10.380
Mmm.

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:12.460
To Athena.

00:07:13.190 --> 00:07:14.710
To Athena.

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:25.790
You are?

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.840
Return to Five Ancient Peaks.

00:07:35.340 --> 00:07:36.150
Ikki.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.110
Why do you aim your fists at me?

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:42.630
Athena said to stay out of the Sanctuary.

00:07:43.180 --> 00:07:47.190
If we trespass, our lives cannot be promised.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:51.100
But...

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:56.400
Athena has deemed the Bronze Saints useless.

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:02.110
But we cannot abandon her.

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:06.070
Ikki, if you are Athena's Saint,

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:08.820
it's your duty to fight in her name.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:22.090
I am not taking sides.

00:08:22.530 --> 00:08:23.380
What did you say?

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:25.700
Then why are you here?

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:27.780
To observe.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:33.150
This will most likely be the final holy war.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:40.280
Damn you. If you know that,
how can you just watch?

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:50.180
Shiryu, why do you insist
on being Athena's Saint?

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:52.510
To survive?

00:08:52.970 --> 00:08:54.920
Or because it is an order?

00:08:58.240 --> 00:08:59.260
No.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:03.510
No one forced me, nor did Athena order me.

00:09:04.280 --> 00:09:06.010
Then why?

00:09:06.740 --> 00:09:09.880
I want to protect Athena and my friends.

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:14.860
And the people Athena wants to protect.

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.740
What's so funny?

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.410
What can you do with that body?

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:28.330
There's no point of you being here.

00:09:29.030 --> 00:09:33.930
Even if there is no point, I will fight!

00:09:34.870 --> 00:09:36.210
For myself.

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.430
For the bond of friendship.

00:09:42.160 --> 00:09:44.460
If you're trying to stop me,

00:09:44.860 --> 00:09:45.780
I will...

00:09:53.180 --> 00:09:56.010
They are all fools.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.090
What?

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:05.660
There was another idiot
like you over there.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.230
Another? Seiya.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.170
Wait, Ikki.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:18.380
What about you?

00:10:19.320 --> 00:10:20.460
I already told you.

00:10:21.190 --> 00:10:24.290
That I will not take sides.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:30.760
Ikki.

00:10:37.780 --> 00:10:40.440
The Aries house fire has gone out.

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:45.970
Now the Taurus, even the Gemini
flame is about to go out.

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.770
Damn, Saga and the others,

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:52.920
why don't they clear the Cancer house?

00:10:56.450 --> 00:11:00.490
They must have found the
entrance to the Underworld.

00:11:00.670 --> 00:11:01.550
What?

00:11:03.040 --> 00:11:06.880
Even if the dead wander into this world,

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:12.130
the only place for them to
return is the Underworld.

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:16.530
Are you sure you want to say that, Dohko?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:22.650
It's a matter of time
before you join the dead.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:28.750
In the previous holy war
that we fought with Athena,

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.330
only you and I...

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.480
The two of us were the only survivors.

00:11:35.660 --> 00:11:40.540
This holy war will be longer and more cruel.

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:47.230
There will be no survivors. The
Saints will become extinct.

00:11:48.830 --> 00:11:55.100
The first bloodbath will be the Gold
Saint guardians of the 12 houses.

00:11:57.960 --> 00:12:04.070
If that is the will of the Gods, so be it.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:11.800
Seiya!

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:14.540
Seiya!

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:18.290
Seiya.

00:12:20.330 --> 00:12:21.300
Seiya.

00:12:25.690 --> 00:12:26.930
I see.

00:12:27.440 --> 00:12:33.000
I've returned to the Colosseum where
I fought for the Pegasus Cloth.

00:12:33.950 --> 00:12:36.070
Why are you here?

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:41.660
Mu sent me here to save me.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:43.080
Mu?

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:46.520
Shiryu, why are you here?

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:50.030
Ikki told me.

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:53.960
Ikki? That's great!

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.270
If Ikki joins us, we're invincible.

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.290
What's wrong? Where's Ikki?

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.400
He's not with you?

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:08.120
Ikki won't be joining us.

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.190
What?

00:13:10.370 --> 00:13:13.790
He says there is no point
in us fighting anymore.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:17.310
What? Ikki said such a thing?

00:13:23.340 --> 00:13:25.380
The Gemini house flame went out.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.560
Back then too...

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:30.620
The clock tower was burning.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:34.400
That's right.

00:13:35.590 --> 00:13:39.340
Back then, we also fought for Athena.

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:47.940
Ikki, you coward! You dirty bastard!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.470
I don't care about him!

00:13:53.470 --> 00:13:53.810
No.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:54.370
What?

00:13:55.370 --> 00:13:58.380
Ikki is not joining us
not because he's afraid.

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:03.850
He's not that kind of man. You know best.

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:08.300
What are you talking about, Shiryu?

00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:12.060
Ikki tried to run you out of the Sanctuary.

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:15.820
Mu did the same.

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:29.420
There's nothing to say. One
day we will understand.

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.180
I hope so.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:41.800
More importantly, we need to get to Athena.

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:44.520
We must consider the opponent.

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:50.100
Those zombies from the
Underworld are no match.

00:14:50.650 --> 00:14:52.410
Let's go, Shiryu.

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:53.570
Hmm.

00:15:00.890 --> 00:15:02.550
Friendship, you say.

00:15:07.950 --> 00:15:11.420
Shun, do you think so too?

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:27.500
What's going on?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:33.100
I feel like we've run around
the Cancer house for hours.

00:15:33.650 --> 00:15:36.730
True. However...

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:41.690
It also feels like we've been
here for only a couple minutes.

00:15:41.930 --> 00:15:47.010
Whichever it is, this seems
like another illusion.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:55.720
It's like God is playing tricks on us.

00:15:56.150 --> 00:15:57.610
This Cosmo.

00:16:05.530 --> 00:16:06.970
This light.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.060
All right, let's escape this illusion.

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:25.120
Saga.

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:25.680
What's wrong?

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:29.070
It's not an exit. This is...

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:46.390
Buddha's palm.

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:54.140
We thought we were running for hours.

00:16:54.280 --> 00:17:00.230
But we were only on Buddha's palm.

00:17:04.980 --> 00:17:06.190
I got it.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.580
There's only one who can pull this off.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.870
It must be him.

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.990
The one closest to God.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:23.180
Virgo Shaka!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.560
Virgo Shaka.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:29.770
That man...

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:33.710
He's been manipulating these
illusions from the Virgo house.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:36.700
And toying with us.

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.740
But now we know the opponent is Shaka.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.830
We can fight back.

00:17:46.240 --> 00:17:49.710
Shaka, everything won't go as you planned.

00:17:50.600 --> 00:17:53.320
The next of the Gold Saints to die...

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:56.220
Shaka, it's you!

00:18:09.240 --> 00:18:11.290
The Buddha illusion has vanished.

00:18:11.390 --> 00:18:14.620
Now we can get out of the Cancer house.

00:18:14.620 --> 00:18:16.960
No, not yet.

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:18.070
What?

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:23.710
We've only eliminated the
illusion in front of us.

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:28.480
Unless we defeat the creator
of the illusions, Shaka,

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:32.270
we cannot clear the Cancer house.

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:35.210
Unless we defeat Shaka.

00:18:35.790 --> 00:18:38.240
Exactly, look.

00:18:50.080 --> 00:18:52.550
Infinite illusions continue.

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:08.580
Shaka, will you not let us out?

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:12.320
Do you mean to trap us in
the Cancer house forever?

00:19:12.570 --> 00:19:18.130
No, even Shaka couldn't go
up against all three of us.

00:19:19.150 --> 00:19:24.700
He's just trying to run
time off the clock tower.

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:33.000
So if we are fooled by the trickery,
we'll playing right into his hand.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:35.550
To break it...

00:19:38.700 --> 00:19:40.300
I will have you die!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:41.690
Shaka!

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.640
I feel a Cosmo from the Cancer house again.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.250
One as strong as the one
that hit the Pope's chambers

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:54.080
is headed to the Virgo house.

00:19:56.800 --> 00:20:00.500
Watch out! At this distance, the
Virgo house will fall apart.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:04.310
Shaka.

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:12.080
Did we do it?

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.800
No, that Shaka.

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:19.900
He put up a perfect shield.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:24.640
Camus, Shura and Saga.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:28.590
Even though you've pledged
yourselves to Hades,

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:31.990
we once fought as Athena's Saints.

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:36.870
Thus, I just wanted to contain
you within the Cancer house.

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:42.360
What's that?

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:47.310
Shaka's Cosmo is igniting to the fullest.

00:21:06.460 --> 00:21:08.300
Treasure of Heaven!

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:25.170
Again. First, it was from the Cancer
to the Virgo house. Now it's reversed.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.180
Ah.

00:21:26.420 --> 00:21:28.370
A powerful Cosmo exploded.

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:29.980
We must hurry.

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:32.840
Something big has happened.

00:21:32.840 --> 00:21:33.510
Ah.

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:44.690
Saga and the others' Cosmo have
disappeared in an instance.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.650
Could they have?

00:21:47.060 --> 00:21:52.110
They may have returned to the Underworld.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:59.660
Are you worried about your friends, Shion?

00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:05.170
At this rate, everything is
ruined. I have no other choice.

00:22:05.440 --> 00:22:07.130
Where are you going, Shion?

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:13.080
As long as I'm here, you cannot leave.

00:22:17.080 --> 00:22:22.010
Then, Dohko, I must defeat you first.

00:22:27.290 --> 00:22:31.470
Former friend, comrade in combat.

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:33.950
So I wanted to wait until later...

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:38.200
Sooner or later, I would
have had to kill you.

00:22:38.890 --> 00:22:45.420
Then I guess I must kill you before that.

00:22:45.840 --> 00:22:47.710
Here I come, Dohko!

00:22:48.950 --> 00:22:50.590
All right, Shion!

00:24:17.470 --> 00:24:19.800
Is there nothing Shiryu and Old Master

00:24:20.050 --> 00:24:22.280
can do against Shion's fierce evil attack?

00:24:23.020 --> 00:24:27.020
The time has come to release
Athena's ancient seal!

00:24:28.020 --> 00:24:31.610
When you see the image of young Dohko
reflected behind the Old Master,

00:24:31.810 --> 00:24:34.100
the shining warrior will be resurrected!

00:24:34.790 --> 00:24:37.520
Saint Seiya, "The Warrior
from Ancient Times."

00:24:37.990 --> 00:24:40.830
Do you sense the Cosmo?
